  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonar Music SA - SommerOase 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonar Music South Africa proposes a network activity sending three core volunteer leaders of Sonar Music SA to SommerOase, Denmark&apos;s largest summer camp organized by DanskOase, attended by over 5,000 people, many of whom are youth. This opportunity allows our leaders to collaborate with Sonar Music Denmark in hosting concerts, facilitating sound and lighting in the various youth venues, and managing live broadcasts and so on. The network activity aims to foster cross-cultural exchanges, enhance professional skills, and strengthen international ties with Youth For Christ Denmark (Sonar Music DK). The experience follows on from the successful network activity in July 2022, enriching our volunteers with new expertise and cultural insights.</narrative>
  </description>
